    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2364b4e6a86a18be621c528b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们才是顶点。放马过来吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bd31defe1bf5a3aea49757d9350ba9b74a83b406ab8ab79dc56dceca126e500",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1129/storytimeline_041129001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4407722e16eea64a5e8ea669",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——听见了喧嚣声。\n前方的……在那光芒的深处，溢出了热忱、梦想与希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41df9e40aa1602bbc533f404ad49765597437f015ef80ae7952e920092ac9280",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1129/storytimeline_041129001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d5136170179441e491f0e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谁都在等待着。\n等待着变化。等待着那个能带来变化的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f849d13bdfd0de396b0cf02dcda2ad9274253ee38a945b44f951170c7df5ae6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1129/storytimeline_041129001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df1591f3e33096332c72c2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊——杏目。去赢下来吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "a325202242f5ce150afeb6845df0ab6a5a3844bc56b34faaca65b78f2caf2781",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1129/storytimeline_041129001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:466badc9c9637de7b52f11c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯——杏目。去赢下来吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0dc8e4d1bf6055e98d55a850f465178337ebc94a1f28af4e7711a979214f73d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1129/storytimeline_041129001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
