      "uid": "zhcn:66a9adfdc6ab5b9cecb292f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到底，能获得哪怕1场GⅠ赛事的胜利都已是惊人的壮举。\n鲁道夫象征等人的GⅠ7胜，简直就像是神迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0921f4e188ee60f4c324cc12fbd1f7291e7cb67030f6ef69489a49e8d4be2c24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
