      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "舒展的跑姿动作很大，她扬起尘土瞬间加速。\n那双紧盯着前方的眼眸，灵动而又炯炯有神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba875f1c3ed4e775897adea4a67e7cb0889e74383c2a39c6df939394c5c4794c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
